{"video_id":"jgy-011","points":[{"kp_id":"jgy-011.kp0001","video_id":"jgy-011","type":"clinical_tip","statement":"金匮第十篇分腹满、寒疝、宿食三纲；腹满须先辨虚实。","evidence_quote":"腹满","start_s":3.58,"end_s":9.18,"confidence":0.95},{"kp_id":"jgy-011.kp0002","video_id":"jgy-011","type":"formula_indication","statement":"单纯气胀可用生姜半夏人参甘草汤消气滞。","evidence_quote":"生姜半夏人参","start_s":69.27,"end_s":77.28,"confidence":0.85},{"kp_id":"jgy-011.kp0003","video_id":"jgy-011","type":"formula_indication","statement":"虚寒腹满当温药，如理中类（人参白术茯苓甘草姜）。","evidence_quote":"里中汤","start_s":176.08,"end_s":182.615,"confidence":0.85},{"kp_id":"jgy-011.kp0004","video_id":"jgy-011","type":"diagnostic_rule","statement":"腹满按之不痛为虚，当温药；按之痛或苔黄为实，可攻下。","evidence_quote":"按之，不痛为虚","start_s":186.09,"end_s":191.955,"confidence":0.95},{"kp_id":"jgy-011.kp0005","video_id":"jgy-011","type":"clinical_tip","statement":"腹诊虚实取天枢等穴：按之舒适属虚，拒按剧痛属实。","evidence_quote":"天枢","start_s":208.01,"end_s":215.175,"confidence":0.9},{"kp_id":"jgy-011.kp0006","video_id":"jgy-011","type":"pathomechanism","statement":"腹满时胀时止属虚寒当温；持续胀满属实（燥屎等）。","evidence_quote":"时好时坏","start_s":534.76,"end_s":544.54,"confidence":0.9},{"kp_id":"jgy-011.kp0007","video_id":"jgy-011","type":"clinical_tip","statement":"病者萎黄躁而不渴，胸中寒实又下利不止，阴阳两竭为死证。","evidence_quote":"寒食","start_s":682.78,"end_s":691.205,"confidence":0.85},{"kp_id":"jgy-011.kp0008","video_id":"jgy-011","type":"formula_indication","statement":"胸中寒实结胸用三物小白散；组成贝母、桔梗、巴豆。","evidence_quote":"贝母、桔梗","start_s":734.57,"end_s":740.165,"confidence":0.95},{"kp_id":"jgy-011.kp0009","video_id":"jgy-011","type":"formula_composition","statement":"三物小白散剂量巴豆三重、余药各一（三三一），误用极险。","evidence_quote":"巴豆三","start_s":787.19,"end_s":796.31,"confidence":0.9},{"kp_id":"jgy-011.kp0010","video_id":"jgy-011","type":"contraindication","statement":"绕脐痛属风冷、腑气不行时勿妄投承气；误下致心下痞可用泻心汤类补救。","evidence_quote":"五个泻心汤","start_s":1247.65,"end_s":1254.56,"confidence":0.85},{"kp_id":"jgy-011.kp0011","video_id":"jgy-011","type":"formula_indication","statement":"腹满发热十余日脉浮而数、饮食如故，厚朴七物汤（桂枝汤去芍加厚朴枳实大黄）。","evidence_quote":"腹满","start_s":1288.77,"end_s":1296.825,"confidence":0.85},{"kp_id":"jgy-011.kp0012","video_id":"jgy-011","type":"formula_composition","statement":"厚朴七物去厚朴枳实大黄余桂枝生姜甘草大枣，即桂枝汤去芍；因腹满无腹痛故去白芍。","evidence_quote":"桂枝汤","start_s":1330.85,"end_s":1335.185,"confidence":0.9},{"kp_id":"jgy-011.kp0013","video_id":"jgy-011","type":"clinical_tip","statement":"雷鸣切痛属寒痛，非必肿瘤；附子粳米汤常一剂知、二剂已。","evidence_quote":"雷鸣切痛","start_s":1615.65,"end_s":1618.805,"confidence":0.85},{"kp_id":"jgy-011.kp0014","video_id":"jgy-011","type":"formula_indication","statement":"腹寒雷鸣切痛（剧痛如肠套叠）用附子粳米汤温中降逆止呕。","evidence_quote":"附子汤","start_s":1654.31,"end_s":1656.65,"confidence":0.9},{"kp_id":"jgy-011.kp0015","video_id":"jgy-011","type":"diagnostic_rule","statement":"小承气：满而不痛之便秘；厚朴三物：痛而闭，重用厚朴；大/小承气以有无矢气辨大肠/小肠燥结。","evidence_quote":"三物汤","start_s":1974.27,"end_s":1982.71,"confidence":0.95},{"kp_id":"jgy-011.kp0016","video_id":"jgy-011","type":"diagnostic_rule","statement":"小承气证多矢气（燥结在小肠、大肠空）；大承气证连屁亦无（燥结已入大肠）。","evidence_quote":"大承气汤","start_s":2069.52,"end_s":2070.655,"confidence":0.95},{"kp_id":"jgy-011.kp0017","video_id":"jgy-011","type":"formula_indication","statement":"痛而闭者厚朴三物汤；满而不痛便秘者小承气汤。","evidence_quote":"痛而闭着","start_s":2075.94,"end_s":2081.405,"confidence":0.95}]}